        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***FOURTH FLOOR APARTMENT / PRIVATE UNDERGROUND PARKING SPACE / SPACIOUS INTERIOR / SUPERB LOCATION / CLOSE TO DUBLIN AIRPORT & M50 / NO RENTAL CAPS***\r\n\r\nKELLY BRADSHAW are truly delighted to introduce 322 Carrington, Northwood, Santry, Dublin 9 to the market. \r\n\r\nThis exceptional two bedroom, two bathroom, 4th floor apartment that has been beautifully curated to blend warmth with modern convenience.\r\n\r\nLovingly maintained and well presented, this home is a rare blend of personality, comfort, and practicality, nestled within the leafy tranquillity of Santry Demesne. The property offers a space that not only looks striking but feels like home from the moment you step inside.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you're immediately welcomed by a spacious, light-filled hallway with warm oak hardwood flooring that effortlessly flows from room to room, creating a polished finish and setting the tone for what lies beyond.\r\n\r\nTo the right, an expansive open-plan living and dining area is framed by floor-to-ceiling windows and doors that open out onto a generous private balcony. Perched high on the fourth floor, this superb outdoor space is perfect for a morning coffee or unwinding in the evening with a glass of wine, boasting elevated views over the peaceful, mature greenery of the manicured courtyard.\r\n\r\nThe living room offers a warm and welcoming space, perfect for gathering with family, hosting friends, or entertaining guests over dinner. Thoughtfully designed, it features a generous room for comfortable living, elegant dining, and even a dedicated workspace for those working from home.\r\n\r\nOff the living area is the fully fitted kitchen, complete with sleek cream gloss cabinetry, contrast wood-trim accents, and premium black granite-effect countertops. With integrated appliances and stunning stone tiling underfoot, it is both stylish and functional, a space you’ll thoroughly enjoy spending time in, whether prepping for guests or simply cooking a quiet dinner at home.\r\n\r\nFurther along, both double bedrooms are generously sized, offering excellent layouts. The primary bedroom is a massive, light-filled sanctuary featuring its own dedicated Walk-In Closet, a rare and invaluable addition to apartment living that provides exceptional custom timber storage. The second double bedroom boasts a neutral color palette, expansive window views, and ample space for freestanding furniture.\r\n\r\nThe main family bathroom continues the theme of high-end finishes with beautiful, warm travertine-style stone tiling, a pristine white ceramic suite, and a full-sized bath with an overhead shower. A convenient guest bathroom and an extra hall storage closet complete the interior accommodation.\r\n\r\nLocated within the vibrant Northwood development, residents benefit from easy access to Santry Demesne Park, Northwood Fitness Centre, Gulliver’s Retail Park, and top-tier transport links including the M1, M50, and Dublin Airport, just minutes away. Whether you’re a first-time buyer, downsizing, or looking for a premium investment property, 322 Carrington is an invitation to enjoy an elevated home that perfectly balances warmth, style, and an exceptional location in one of Dublin’s most peaceful urban pockets."
      },
